{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And he shall make atonement for the holy place.</b> This is the holy of holies." "<b>And so he shall do for the Tent of Meeting.</b> That he sprinkles seven times before the curtain and on the horns of the altar of incense." "The sense of <b>and he shall make atonement for the holy place</b> is that the blood makes atonement so that it is not destroyed on account of the impurity of the impure ones."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:25.325152958Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}